    "stated": "no key required; 22 model ids on /v1/models, each carrying a pricing object in USD per token. Twelve of the 22 are chat models and two of those, Qwen3Guard-Gen-0.6B and Qwen3Guard-Gen-8B, price at exactly zero on prompt and completion. The other 10 ids are one image model, three embedding models, four TTS models and two ASR models",
