    "source_url": "https://oai.endpoints.kepler.ai.cloud.ovh.net/v1/models",
    "read_on": "2026-10-22",
    "notes": "the pricing object is published per model and is the machine form of 'free'. Qwen3Guard-Gen-0.6B and Qwen3Guard-Gen-8B are the only two chat models priced at exactly zero on both prompt and completion. No chat model is priced at 0.00000001 USD: that figure belongs to the two embedding models bge-m3 and bge-multilingual-gemma2"
  },
